# CODEOWNERS (SEC-04, M1-011). docs/security/github-settings.md, section 9, explains the setup.
#
# The last matching line wins. Every line has the same owner while Rdy has one maintainer, so a
# code owner review cannot be required yet (nobody can approve their own PR). The security block
# still matters: it names the paths where a change needs a security-reviewer review (05, 04
# section 4, ADR 0014), and it is where a second maintainer or a security team is added first.

# Default owner.
*                                       @getrdy-io

# ---- Security paths --------------------------------------------------------------------------

